OL,3,GNEWSACar parks and roads shut as
OL,4,Adevelopment work starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo car parks in a city centre are to
OL,7,Fclose as the construction of a housing
OL,8,Fdevelopment begins.
OL,10,FThe car park near Hay Street and the
OL,11,Fcar park opposite St Peter's Metro
OL,12,FStation in Sunderland will shut from
OL,13,FMonday as works start to transform the
OL,14,FSheepfolds Industrial Estate near the
OL,15,FStadium of Light.
OL,17,FRoads and on-street car parking within
OL,18,Fthe Sheepfolds neighbourhood would also
OL,19,Fshut from Monday for the delivery of
OL,20,Fmajor drainage, site remediation and
OL,21,Fgroundworks, the local authority said.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
